'''Gift of Learning''' is a {{Rare}} consumable.

== Obtaining ==
Up to {{Green|8}} '''Gift of Learning''' by reaching {{Rmt|&aGift Milestone XXV}} at {{NPCSprite|Generow}}.

A '''Gift of Learning''' can also be obtained as a {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward from the [[Raffle of the Century]] or {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Usage ==
Players can use a '''Gift of Learning''' to grant themselves +10,000 [[Skill]] XP to one of 8 different skills:
*{{Skill|Farming}}
*{{Skill|Mining}}
*{{Skill|Combat}}
*{{Skill|Foraging}}
*{{Skill|Fishing}}
*{{Skill|Enchanting}}
*{{Skill|Alchemy}}
*{{Skill|Hunting}}

